[Unit]
Description=RANDOM like pool, counted twelve times a day (the zones around the likes and their sizes, for the draw, the taste card and the drift; stopped by mistake with the old lines on 2 October, back on 15 October at the hours the small model leaves the machine's memory — every hour it would run beside a 700 MB model on a 969 MB machine)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00,05,06,09,11,12,14,16,18,21,22,23:20:00 Europe/Paris
Persistent=false
RandomizedDelaySec=60

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
